+It also preserves the pre-existing behavior of warning about and removing unknown fields (e.g. `{unknown_attr} {path} {line} {msg_id} {msg}` still warns once and drops `{unknown_attr}`), which is what the existing reporter tests rely on. The now-unused `import re` was removed and `import string` added.
